# Cloud Functions runtime configuration — NON-SECRET values only.
#
# Copy to functions/.env (git-ignored) to override the defaults, or to
# functions/.env.metro-health-0001 to scope it to that project. Firebase
# reads these at deploy time and makes them available to the functions
# at runtime; no Secret Manager and no Blaze-only feature is involved.
#
# Anything that IS a credential (Razorpay/Cloudinary keys) belongs in
# Secret Manager via `firebase functions:secrets:set`, never here.

# The email address that receives SUPER_ADMIN automatically on sign-in.
# This is the ONLY way a SUPER_ADMIN is ever created. Every other staff
# role is assigned from Admin -> Settings -> Admin & Staff.
#
# Leave unset to use the committed default in src/masterAdmin.ts.
MASTER_ADMIN_EMAIL=you@gmail.com
